docs/ML for accounting and management/A dynamic model of bank behaviour under multiple regulatory constraints Behn(19).pdf:Zone.Identifier\ndocs/design/fixtures/p03-lowering-cases-v1.json\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Using accounting earnings and aggregate economic indicators to estimate firm-level systematic risk Ball(21).pdf\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Math/An algebraic model for the representation of accounting systems Nehmer(97).pdf:Zone.Identifier\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Math/Domain specific Language for accounting Babcinetchi(22).pdf\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Math/Double-entry bookkeeping for Social and Environmental accounting A Framework To Apply Lessons From Financial Accounting To Non-Financial Domains Renes(24).pdf:Zone.Identifier\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Math/An algebraic model for the representation of accounting systems Nehmer(97).pdf\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Math/Domain specific Language for accounting Babcinetchi(22).pdf:Zone.Identifier\ndocs/ML for accounting and management/Math/Double-entry bookkeeping for Social and Environmental accounting A Framework To Apply Lessons From Financial Accounting To Non-Financial Domains Renes(24).pdf\ndocs/design/review/pre-expert-preparation-2026-10-02/docs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md\ndocs/design/review/pre-expert-preparation-2026-10-02/docs/plans/accounting-product-design-checkpoint.md\ndocs/design/review/pre-expert-preparation-2026-10-02/docs/design/accounting-product-design.tex\ndocs/design/review/pre-expert-preparation-2026-10-02/docs/design/accounting-product-design.pdf\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
