reserve current/later/source-blocked obligations; implementation order remains in Ch. 11. Wider mission and acceptance stay active. G1–G18. |\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md:124:| MC35 | Complete feasible internal preparation before paid professional review and minimise avoidable reviewer effort. U4. | Allocate every residual gap to internal work or a specific professional judgment; supply checked facts, dated sources, a proposed answer, counterargument and consequences before referral. Any later engagement has explicit user authority and an agreed bounded scope/cost. Keep human acceptance separate from continued internal work. | Standing rule installed in mission/AGENTS. All G1–G18 allocated in `review/internal-before-expert.md`; debt semantic checks, three source dossiers, journal checks and manuscript corrections completed. The review brief is unsent; actual-company facts, source and implementation tasks remain internal. No paid-review readiness, spending authority or savings estimate is claimed. The eight-year corpus, provenance checks, 20 regression tests and annotation preparation format were completed internally without professional engagement. |\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P03/result.md\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P03/progress.md\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P03/conformance.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/borrowings.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/sectors.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/core-ir-structure.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/borrowing.acc\ndocs/design/fixtures/northstar.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/corpus-protocol.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/p03-lowering-cases-v1.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/demo-debt-package.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/core-demo-registry.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/temporal.json\ndocs/design/fixtures/core-ir-demo.json\ntests/__pycache__/test_accounting_p02.cpython-311.pyc\ntests/__pycache__/test_accounting_master.cpython-311.pyc\ntests/__pycache__/test_accounting_p03.cpython-311.pyc\ntests/test_accounting_p03.py\nte